tinyssb-core implements the tinySSB v0 main-entry and side-chain verification
rules from the pinned MIT tinySSB ESP32 core:

  https://github.com/ssbc/tinySSB/tree/39896b72c97b51159d46610c5f11ff7f5a279031

Consulted source paths:

  esp32/loramesh-TBeam/config.h
  esp32/loramesh-TBeam/replica.h
  esp32/loramesh-TBeam/replica.cpp
  esp32/loramesh-TBeam/bipf.cpp

The implementation is an independently written Rust verifier. No Android
source or Codec2 material is used.
